# CODEOWNERS - Automatic Reviewer Assignment
#
# This file defines code ownership for the KDx Portal repository.
# When a pull request modifies files, GitHub automatically requests
# reviews from the designated owners.
#
# Syntax: <file-pattern> <owner1> <owner2> ...
# Owners can be: @username, @org/team-name, or email@example.com
#
# More specific patterns override less specific ones.
# Last matching pattern takes precedence.

# Default owner for all files
* @bryanra

